{
    "title": "Opera News: breaking & local",
    "description": "Opera News is proud to be one of the most popular news app which enjoyed and trusted by <b>over 350 million global users.</b>Why?\r\n\r\nBecause Opera News\u2019 personalized news aggregator refines the noisy daily news cycle into one powerful feed. <b>In short, we make staying informed easy.</b>\r\n\r\nSorting through hundreds of thousands of stories each day, we find the perfect content to fit you, all in a fast, easy-to-read format. And the more you use it, the better our recommendations get.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022Top US & International News Sources</b>\r\nWith access to 15,000+ sources from top publishers, Opera News delivers a wide variety of US news and International news content. You'll never miss the most important headlines and trending news.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022Local News For Your City</b>\r\nGet local news from your neighborhood, city, county, and state. Stay informed about what's happening around you.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022Breaking News Notifications</b>\r\nStay updated with real-time news alerts. Our system provides breaking news notifications from every top publisher, ensuring you\u2019re always in the know.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022Not your pappy\u2019s News Aggregator</b>\r\nOur cutting-edge next-gen personalization system uses advanced machine learning and an editorial team from 11 countries to bring you the most relevant custom news feed. The more you engage, the better it gets.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022Specialized Channels</b>\r\nExplore a variety of specialized channels that focus on current events and major holidays. Our curated channels provide in-depth coverage and exclusive content on significant happenings such as the US elections, major sporting events, and important cultural holidays. Whether you're looking for detailed reports on political events, insights into major celebrations, or updates on key holidays, you'll find it all in one place.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022Videos & Clips</b>\r\nWatch videos and explore clips for a richer news experience. Unlike other video platforms, we focus on content from trusted sources, ensuring that you receive accurate and reliable information. Whether it's breaking news, in-depth reports, or insightful analysis, our video content is curated to keep you well-informed.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022Dark mode</b>\r\nAllows you to comfortably read breaking news and real-time updates at night or in low-light conditions.\r\n\r\n<b>. . . And that's not all.</b>\r\nReader mode for fast loading\uff1aExperience lightning-fast loading times with our optimized reader mode.\r\n\r\nOffline reading & safe for later\uff1aSave articles for offline reading so you can catch up on news anytime, even without an internet connection.\r\n\r\nData Savings\uff1aEnjoy the latest news while saving on data usage with our efficient data-saving mode.\r\n\r\nSearch feature\uff1aEasily find specific news articles with our powerful search feature.\r\n\r\nComment forums\uff1aJoin the conversation and share your thoughts in our comment forums.\r\n\r\nCommunity groups & sharing\uff1aConnect with others through community groups and share your favorite articles.\r\n\r\nData dashboards\uff1aTrack trends and insights with our detailed data dashboards.\r\n\r\nCustomizable political content\uff1aTailor your news feed to include more of the political news that matters to you.\r\n\r\nNews bar \uff1aStay on top of the latest news with our convenient news bar.\r\n\r\n\u2026 And always continually innovating\r\n\r\n<b>\u2022Facts, and Fun</b>\r\nDepending on your interests, our channels present a mix of quality news and fun articles. Discover World News, National News, Tech News, and more from newspapers, TV, magazines, digital publications, blogs, vlogs, and adorable dog stories.\r\n\r\n<b>It\u2019s a crazy world, stay sane with Opera News.</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Opera News is proud to be one of the most popular news app which enjoyed and trusted by <b>over 350 million global users.</b>Why?<br><br>Because Opera News\u2019 personalized news aggregator refines the noisy daily news cycle into one powerful feed. <b>In short, we make staying informed easy.</b><br><br>Sorting through hundreds of thousands of stories each day, we find the perfect content to fit you, all in a fast, easy-to-read format. And the more you use it, the better our recommendations get.<br><br><b>\u2022Top US &amp; International News Sources</b><br>With access to 15,000+ sources from top publishers, Opera News delivers a wide variety of US news and International news content. You&#39;ll never miss the most important headlines and trending news.<br><br><b>\u2022Local News For Your City</b><br>Get local news from your neighborhood, city, county, and state. Stay informed about what&#39;s happening around you.<br><br><b>\u2022Breaking News Notifications</b><br>Stay updated with real-time news alerts. Our system provides breaking news notifications from every top publisher, ensuring you\u2019re always in the know.<br><br><b>\u2022Not your pappy\u2019s News Aggregator</b><br>Our cutting-edge next-gen personalization system uses advanced machine learning and an editorial team from 11 countries to bring you the most relevant custom news feed. The more you engage, the better it gets.<br><br><b>\u2022Specialized Channels</b><br>Explore a variety of specialized channels that focus on current events and major holidays. Our curated channels provide in-depth coverage and exclusive content on significant happenings such as the US elections, major sporting events, and important cultural holidays. Whether you&#39;re looking for detailed reports on political events, insights into major celebrations, or updates on key holidays, you&#39;ll find it all in one place.<br><br><b>\u2022Videos &amp; Clips</b><br>Watch videos and explore clips for a richer news experience. Unlike other video platforms, we focus on content from trusted sources, ensuring that you receive accurate and reliable information. Whether it&#39;s breaking news, in-depth reports, or insightful analysis, our video content is curated to keep you well-informed.<br><br><b>\u2022Dark mode</b><br>Allows you to comfortably read breaking news and real-time updates at night or in low-light conditions.<br><br><b>. . . And that&#39;s not all.</b><br>Reader mode for fast loading\uff1aExperience lightning-fast loading times with our optimized reader mode.<br><br>Offline reading &amp; safe for later\uff1aSave articles for offline reading so you can catch up on news anytime, even without an internet connection.<br><br>Data Savings\uff1aEnjoy the latest news while saving on data usage with our efficient data-saving mode.<br><br>Search feature\uff1aEasily find specific news articles with our powerful search feature.<br><br>Comment forums\uff1aJoin the conversation and share your thoughts in our comment forums.<br><br>Community groups &amp; sharing\uff1aConnect with others through community groups and share your favorite articles.<br><br>Data dashboards\uff1aTrack trends and insights with our detailed data dashboards.<br><br>Customizable political content\uff1aTailor your news feed to include more of the political news that matters to you.<br><br>News bar \uff1aStay on top of the latest news with our convenient news bar.<br><br>\u2026 And always continually innovating<br><br><b>\u2022Facts, and Fun</b><br>Depending on your interests, our channels present a mix of quality news and fun articles. Discover World News, National News, Tech News, and more from newspapers, TV, magazines, digital publications, blogs, vlogs, and adorable dog stories.<br><br><b>It\u2019s a crazy world, stay sane with Opera News.</b>",
